Please focus narrowly on residual risks in the final uncommitted patch:
- stmap90 hook in mapperMatch.c should be inactive unless configured and activated.
- stmap65 should activate/deactivate stmap90 in the same final-remap windows as stmap87-89.
- stmap90 should not change stmap89, older stmap commands, or classic map behavior.
- Build registration should include src/base/abci/abcStmap_90.c and command registration should expose stmap90.
- Generated eval artifacts should be sufficient for the campaign gate.

Report actionable findings only; if none, say there are no actionable correctness issues.

